{"articleNo":"1337","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1337&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010 경상북도 해외자문위원협의회 연계 해외인턴십 참가자 선발 계획","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.08.09","hit":"9698","attachments":[{"name":"2010 경상북도 해외자문위원 연계 해외인턴십 사업 추진 계획1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1337&attachNo=69889"},{"name":"이력서및자기소개서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1337&attachNo=70052"},{"name":"자문위원기업리스트1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=1337&attachNo=70206"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment--><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">2010 경상북도 해외자문위원협의회 연계 해외인턴십 참가자 선발 계획을 아래와 같이 통보하오니 관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여를 바랍니다.</span>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 사업주관 : 경상북도 국제통상과<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 파견업체 및 선발인원 : 미국 H-Mart 외 6개국 86명<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 경비지원 : 항공료(편도 혹은 왕복) 등 지원&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 모집공고 : 2010.08.13.(금) - 09.03.(금)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 지원자격 : <font color=\"#ff6600\"><strong>본교 2학기 이상&nbsp;등록한 재학생 및 졸업생<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (휴학생도 지원 가능)</strong><br></font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바. 원서접수 : <font color=\"#0000ff\"><strong>2010.09.01.(수) - 09.03.(금) 17:00 마감</strong></font><br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 사. 접수장소 : <font color=\"#ff0000\"><strong>국제교류센터 행정실(대외협력관 201호)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></font>&nbsp;아. 제출서류&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1) 이력서 및 자기소개서(양식첨부) 각 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 성적증명서 1부<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3) 공인외국어성적소지자(해당자에 한함) 1부.<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 자. 지원자 추천 : 2010.09.10.(금) 예정 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 2010 경상북도 해외자문위원 연계 해외인턴십 사업 추진 계획 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2. 자문위원기업리스트 1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3. 이력서 및 자기소개서 각 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
